  }, {
    "heading": "authentication-types",
    "content": "**API Key**: This authentication type utilizes a static key provided by the service. The key is included in API requests to authenticate the user or service."
  }, {
    "heading": "authentication-types",
    "content": "**Bearer Token**: A Bearer token is a form of authentication where you provide a token (usually received through OAuth) to authorize API calls."
